          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka gwa ikumi na gumoi omu mwezi gwa Buli, nigwo mwezi gwa munana, Rwensinga ekaba yahoire buli kantu, nk'okwo yabaire etegekirwe. Akagyombeka emyaka mushanju.",
          "type": "text",
